<?php $title='Privacy Policy | Mid City Home Restoration';$description='Privacy policy for Mid City Home Restoration.';include __DIR__.'/../includes/header.php';?><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Last updated April 5, 2026</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div></section><section class="section white"><div class="wrap rich" style="max-width:850px"><p>Handyman Handyman & Remodeling, doing business as Mid City Home Restoration, respects your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you visit this website or request services.</p><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>We may collect your name, phone number, email address, property address, project details, budget and timeline preferences, along with basic website usage data.</p><h2>How we use information</h2><p>Information is used to respond to inquiries, prepare estimates, schedule and coordinate work, send project updates, improve the website, and maintain business records. We do not sell personal information for third-party marketing.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>The website may use analytics, mapping, form processing, anti-spam, and project management services. Form details may be sent to ClickUp when the integration is enabled.</p><h2>Security and your rights</h2><p>We use HTTPS, server-side validation, access controls, and security headers. You may request access, correction, or deletion by contacting info@midcityhr.com.</p></div></section><?php include __DIR__.'/../includes/footer.php';?>